 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Learn about UTM tracking, how it works, and how you can use it in your GHL email marketing to better understand how well your marketing efforts are performing.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:pt-0 dark:border-white/20 md:border-transparent md:dark:border-transparent w-full\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"text-base px-3 md:px-4 m-auto md:px-5 lg:px-1 xl:px-5\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex flex-1 gap-4 text-base md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; gap: 4px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"relative flex h-full max-w-full flex-1 flex-col\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex w-full items-center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-[26px] p-1.5 transition-colors bg-[#f4f4f4] dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex items-end gap-1.5 md:gap-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><h2 class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is UTM tracking?</strong></h2><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">UTM parameters are short codes attached to the end of URLs. They assist tools like Google Analytics in identifying the sources of your website traffic. By including UTM parameters in your GHL email campaigns, you can analyze how your messaging impacts your website traffic and conversions.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">In our current implementation, there are 3 UTM parameters that we support by default -</div><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-left: 20px;\">&nbsp;<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">a. utm_source = email :&nbsp;</strong>This is a mandatory field that is kept selected by default and has the value \"email\" for internal tracking purpose<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">b. utm_medium</strong> = email marketing: This is an mandatory field but the value can be customised. The default value is \"email marketing\"<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">c. utm_campaign</strong> = Campaign Name (Send Date): This is an optional fields where the value can be chosen from the drop downs</div><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">You can add additional parameters upto 5 in this list by specifying the value as a text.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Best Practices for UTM Parameters</strong></h2><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Avoid PII:</strong> Do not use personally identifiable information (e.g., social security numbers, addresses). This data is restricted by analytics platforms.</p></li></ol><div class=\"flex-1 overflow-hidden\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"react-scroll-to-bottom--css-isysa-79elbk h-full\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"react-scroll-to-bottom--css-isysa-1n7m0yu\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm md:pb-9\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"w-full text-token-text-primary\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-5\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"text-base py-[18px] px-3 md:px-4 m-auto md:px-5 lg:px-1 xl:px-5\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex flex-1 gap-4 text-base md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; gap: 4px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 overflow-x-auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"018b5808-b359-4c7c-8c7b-9b05beb94812\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; gap: 2px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Use Essential Parameters:</strong> Stick to&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">utm_source</code>,&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">utm_medium</code>, and&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">utm_campaign</code> for clarity and effective analysis.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Consistent Case:</strong> UTM parameters are case sensitive. Choose a capitalization rule and use it consistently.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Prefer Underscores:</strong> Use underscores (_) instead of spaces to avoid encoding issues.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li></ol><h2 class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Where would UTM Parameters would not work?</strong></h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-left: 20px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">1.&nbsp;<strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Trigger Links:&nbsp;</strong>For links under trigger links, the UTM parameters would not work in this version of the release<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">2.&nbsp;<strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Incorrect Syntax:&nbsp;</strong>The links need to have the necessary prefixes like https:// and needs to be correct, specially if they were saved under a custom value</div><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-left: 20px;\">3.&nbsp;<strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Test Emails:&nbsp;</strong>It is advisable to send dummy campaigns to test UTM parameters<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-left: 20px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></strong></div><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Steps to Use UTM Parameters</strong></h2><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Navigate to Email Marketing:</strong> Go to the Email Marketing section of your platform.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Access Settings:</strong> Click on the&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Settings</strong> page under&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Email Campaign</strong>.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Review Tracking Options:</strong> Click on the&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Tracking</strong> option to review the default UTM parameters.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355435/original/oPiXuHWWOd0xOHnMYlvT68seyQBXAnDXDg73ae.png?1761977570\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057355435\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Enable Default UTM Parameters:</strong> To apply UTM parameters to all campaigns by default, toggle the enable switch.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Edit Default Values:</strong> Modify the values for&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">utm_medium</code> or&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">utm_campaign</code> as needed.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Add Custom Parameters:</strong> Click on&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Add Custom Parameter</strong> to specify additional parameters and their values.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355438/original/nk5Y71YcWA2yPlNlkCOR0A3x-vMvWIILuw563d.jpg?1761977571\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057355438\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Select Parameters:</strong> Check the boxes next to the UTM parameters you wish to add to your campaigns.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355437/original/59HhrtRIeVdhvREb_p9XLdoLK70we6Yekg563d.png?1761977571\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057355437\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Save Changes:</strong> Click&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Save</strong> to apply your settings.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355439/original/9MUa4qUZd022wjnlBwCN1-8LG1XJZ_IWjw563d.jpg?1761977571\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057355439\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Disable for Specific Campaigns:</strong> To disable UTM parameters for a particular campaign, turn off the tracking option on the&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Send</strong> or&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Schedule</strong> page.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355434/original/nPqNoXu3v3s4d9-WkmocMWRDW0dD2zxnRw73ae.png?1761977570\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057355434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p></li></ol><h2 class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col pl-4\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; padding-left: 4px; flex: 1 1 0%;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"collab-highlight-btn \" style=\"visibility: hidden; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: rgba(24, 50, 71, 0.4) 0px 3px 8px 0px, rgba(24, 50, 71, 0.3) 0px 0.5px 2px 0px; cursor: pointer; animation: 250ms linear 0s 1 normal forwards running pop-on-top; color: white; height: 30px; padding: 7px 10px;\"></div><p></p><div class=\"attachment-thumb ember-view\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005318-how-to-upload-a-dns-zone-file-during-domain-transfer", "title": "How to Upload a DNS Zone File During Domain Transfer", "folder": "Domain Connect / Transfer", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Export-Zone-Files-from-Registrars\">How to Export Zone Files from Registrars</a><ul><li><a href=\"#GoDaddy\">GoDaddy</a></li><li><a href=\"#Cloudflare\">Cloudflare</a></li><li><a href=\"#Namecheap\">Namecheap</a></li><li><a href=\"#IONOS\">IONOS</a></li></ul></li></ul><hr><div class=\"text__content kbase-content__description\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span class=\"fr-view collab-annotatable\" data-test-id=\"article-description\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: block; cursor: auto;\"><h2 data-end=\"254\" data-start=\"243\" id=\"Overview\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Overview</strong></h2><p data-end=\"475\" data-start=\"256\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">When transferring your domain, it's critical to ensure that your DNS records are preserved. One of the most accurate ways to do this is by <strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"408\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">uploading a DNS Zone File</strong> exported from your current registrar.</p><p data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"477\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This file contains all your domain\u2019s DNS entries including A, CNAME, TXT, MX, and other record types which are essential for keeping your website, email, and other services running smoothly after the transfer.</p><hr data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1315\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page;\"><h2 data-end=\"1368\" data-start=\"1317\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Export-Zone-Files-from-Registrars\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How to Export Zone Files from Registrars</strong></h2><h3 data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1370\" id=\"GoDaddy\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">GoDaddy</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">Learn about how to upload zone files from GoDaddy <a href=\"https://www.godaddy.com/en-in/help/export-my-domains-zone-file-records-4166\">HERE</a>.</p><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Cloudflare\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 3pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Cloudflare</span></h3><h4 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Learn-about-how-to-upload-zone-files-from-Cloudflare-HERE.\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.68; color: rg