le=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"#Key-Notes\">Key Notes</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"#Next-Steps\">Next Steps</a></span></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-is-SEO-Pixel?\" style=\"line-height: 1.96875; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">What is SEO Pixel?</span></span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">The SEO Pixel is a small code snippet that lets us automatically apply&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 700;\">AI-powered SEO fixes</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;(title tags, meta descriptions, image alt text, etc.) to websites that are&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 700;\">not hosted internally</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">Until now, \u201cFix Issue\u201d only worked for internal websites and funnels. With SEO Pixel, you can use the same one-click SEO automation on&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 700;\">WordPress, Wix, custom domains</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">, or even connected WordPress sites where the pixel is not automatically detected.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"li