der-box; font-weight: 700;\">Radio, Single Option:</strong><ul data-identifyelement=\"618\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"619\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Acceptable formats: Value 1 (e.g., Blue).<br data-identifyelement=\"620\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"621\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li></ul></li><li data-identifyelement=\"622\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"623\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Contact Owner:</strong><ul data-identifyelement=\"624\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"625\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Format: FirstName LastName (e.g., Logan Paul).<br data-identifyelement=\"626\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"627\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li></ul></li><li data-identifyelement=\"628\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"629\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Tags:</strong><ul data-identifyelement=\"630\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-identifyelement=\