: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Acceptable formats: 1.23, 1234, .123.<br data-identifyelement=\"644\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"645\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li></ul></li><li data-identifyelement=\"646\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"647\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Monetary:</strong><ul data-identifyelement=\"648\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"649\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Acceptable formats: 1234, 1,234,234.33.<br data-identifyelement=\"650\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"651\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li></ul></li><li data-identifyelement=\"652\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"653\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Contact Followers:</strong><ul data-identifyelement=\"654\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"655\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Acceptable format: FirstName LastName, FirstName2 LastName2 (e.g. Adam Smith, David Lee)<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li></ul></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=