k-between-the-CRM-and-your-email-account?\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1678806875234\" dir=\"ltr\">How does the Gmail 2-way sync work between the CRM and your email account?</strong></span></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1673364830619\" data-identifyelement=\"595\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"596\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1678802581812\" data-identifyelement=\"609\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">There are two cases of how the sync can be established.<br><br>1. You can email a contact from the CRM to initiate the sync between both platforms.<br>2. Gmail Sync also works if a contact already saved in the CRM sends an email to the User (who has Gmail Two Way sync integrated) on their Gmail Email address. The email would sync into the conversations tab. <strong dir=\"ltr\">The contact also needs to be assigned to the user beforehand.</strong></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1690445891253\" data-identifyelement=\"610\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"611\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1673366594483\" data-identifyelement=\"597\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"600\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Please note</strong></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1678791397224\" data-identifyelement=\"601\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If the user is added to multiple sub accounts, and has integrated the same Gmail account for Gmail Two way sync in all those accounts, the email from the contact will go to the conversations tab of all those sub accounts, but we will only retain the instance of that contact in that sub account to which the user replies to. Sync will be broken for all other instances.The additional filter of user being assigned to the existing contact also makes sure that the conversation will not go to sub accounts that the contact does not belong to.</span></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"612\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"613\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1678791551592\" data-identifyelement=\"614\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48287099381/original/5yv1sSHvgI7kZ4JHVVjfZBO59-h2hC2NiQ255b.png?1678791637\" style=\"width: 550px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48287099381\" data-identifyelement=\"615\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680878992468\" data-identifyelement=\"616\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"617\"><br data-identifyelement=\"618\"><br data-identifyelement=\"619\">The sent email will show up in the sent inbox of the integrated Gmail account:<br data-identifyelement=\"620\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48287099648/original/TkUibkPnbsnocvJ7Pe29R3EjDO-IdqMbCgc9b5.png?1678791736\" style=\"width: 552px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48287099648\" data-identifyelement=\"621\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680879005695\" data-identifyelement=\"622\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1039\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680879005695\" data-identifyelement=\"622\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1040\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:</strong></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"1041\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Gmail supports only ~500 emails per day and emails beyond that will be unsuccessful.</span></pre><p class=\"tdfocus-1680878997926\" data-identifyelement=\"623\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"625\"><br data-identifyelement=\"626\"><span cla