box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-4f587b08-c1b7-4f84-a20b-d7318047cbf6\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Which social media platforms are supported?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-06c310d0-8207-4545-b5a1-c4de5cc4abfd\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">You can add icons for major platforms including Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, X (Twitter), YouTube, TikTok, and Pinterest.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-b6007f9b-0661-45ae-a5e8-f8b359d29577\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: How do I add a new social icon that isn\u2019t listed?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-e3750ca5-0ba3-4c63-b5f5-5ade91ee01df\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">You can duplicate an existing icon and replace its image and URL with your custom platform\u2019s logo and link.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-47ca75fc-9e86-49cc-a782-b29c6b12f273\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Are the social icons mobile responsive?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-ed8884d7-59df-441d-adf8-0e3982597048\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, they automatically resize and adjust spacing for smaller screens to ensure a clean, user-friendly layout.</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-ed8884d7-59df-441d-adf8-0e3982597048\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001202217-how-to-download-export-facebook-lead-ads-and-manually-ad-them-to-campaigns-workflows", "title": "How To Download/Export Facebook Lead Ads", "folder": "Facebook", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48158896834/original/8eKOtO8t2eG1yp4wke3OalMoIFQSrHIiNAaa4e.png?1636828873", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48158880724/original/L9GkNYFwG50qmAcvN-NCc4KsVbV6EqBX8Q6797.jpg?1636816443"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"_3p8\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">In Business Suite, you can export a file that contains the information that people submit through your Instant Form. You can also download this data from <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/business/help/794345304231812\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">Ads Manager</a>, request it through the <a href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/docs/marketing-api/guides/lead-ads/leads/v2.5\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">API</a> or access it through an <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/business/help/908902042493104\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">integrated CRM system</a>. We recommend that you download your leads data directly from Business Suite if you don\u2019t have a CRM system integrated with Facebook.</p><h3 class=\"_1sra\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.8em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); padding: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">To download leads data from Business Suite:</span></h3><ol class=\"_341 _3vz5\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.25em; margin-left: 2.4em; list-style: decimal; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Go to <a href=\"https://business.facebook.com/\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">Business Suite</a>.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Click <b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">More Tools</b> from the menu.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Click <b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Instant Forms</b>.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Click <b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Download</b> next to the form with the leads you want to export.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Choose how you want to download your leads:<ul class=\"uiList _341 _3vz6 _4of _4kg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.25em; margin-left: 2.4em; list-style: outside disc; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\"><div class=\"fcb\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Click <b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Download New Leads</b> if you only want to export the leads that you\u2019ve received since the last time you downloaded.</div></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\"><div class=\"fcb\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Click <b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Download by Date Range</b> if you want to download all the leads you\u2019ve received during a certain time period. After you select this option, choose the preferred date range and click <b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Download</b>.</div></li></ul></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0.35em 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">A window appears with your form information. Click <b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">CSV</b> to download the leads data in your preferred file type.</li></ol><p class=\"_3p8\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><b class=\"_9o-0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Note:</b> You have 90 days from the time a lead submits their form to download their information. Leads <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/business/help/1526849577619206\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">expire after 90 days</a>. We recommend that you export your leads data regularly.</p><p class=\"_3p8\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">When you download your file, if you don't see an Ad ID or Ad Set ID field, it may be because:</p><ul class=\"uiList _341 _3vz6 _4of _4kg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.25em; margin-left: 2.4em; list-style: outside disc; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px;\"><div class=\"fcb\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">The lead was generated via organic reach.</div></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px;\"><div class=\"fcb\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">The lead was submitted via an ad preview.</div></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px;\"><div class=\"fcb\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">You don\u2019t have <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/business/help/195296697183682\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">advertiser privileges</a> on the ad account that created the lead ad campaign.</div></li></ul><h3 class=\"_1sra\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.8em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); padding: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">To troubleshoot your file download</span>:</h3><p class=\"_3p8\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">If you can\u2019t download your leads file:</p><ul class=\"uiList _341 _3vz6 _4of _4kg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.25em; margin-left: 2.4em; list-style: outside disc; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px;\"><div class=\"fcb\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">Check with your Business Manager admin to see if they\u2019ve customized access permissions in <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/business/help/1440176552713521\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">Leads Access Manager</a>.</div></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px;\"><div class=\"fcb\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">If they haven\u2019t customized permissions, reach out to your Facebook Page admin to give you the correct access. Before customization, only Facebook Page admins can download leads.</div></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; padding: 0.35em 0px;\"><div class=\"fcb\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\">If they\u2019ve customized permissions, make sure they\u2019ve given you the correct access. After customization, only people <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/business/help/540596413257598\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer;\">assigned access permission</a> can download leads.</div></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"fcb\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; line-height: 30.625px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(29, 33, 41);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">To Import The Leads Into the CRM:</span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">(New UI)</span></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; list-style: outside disc; line-height: 17px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">Navigate to Contacts and click the Import Contacts Bulk Action</span></li></ul><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48158896834/original/8eKOtO8t2eG1yp4wke3OalMoIFQSrHIiNAaa4e.png?1636828873\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48158896834\"></div><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; list-style: outside disc; line-height: 17px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">Select your CSV file and click Next</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">Map the fields from your Facebook Lead Form to your CRM fields and click the Next button</span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">On the Details tab, click the Advanced dropdown, add a tag for these leads (optional), and toggle on \"</span>Add To Workflow/Campaign\" and select the Workflow or Campaign that you'd like to add the leads from the CSV to</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">(Old UI)</span></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; list-style: outside disc; line-height: 17px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">Navigate to Contacts and click the Import Contacts Bulk Action</span></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"im