hdLxn4BgwSgc80b.png?1737013058", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155039922165/original/w-uopj5ps46iFcgKxETnJfh6CdLQWzQcWg87cb.png?1737013057"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h1 class=\"tdfocus-1666642304654\" data-identifyelement=\"492\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 2em; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; line-height: 43.75px !important;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"785\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Error and Opt-out Rate Monitoring</strong></h1><ul data-identifyelement=\"856\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 17px; list-style: outside disc; color: var(--fw-textColor); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1666642313775\" data-identifyelement=\"857\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"817\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">We are focused on helping our customers deliver trusted communications. To make sure that the carrier does not block or suspend the account permanently based on bad usage.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"786\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"787\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li data-identifyelement=\"858\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"818\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">We will be monitoring the delivery rate of the overall account and be taking proactive measures(as mentioned below) to keep the delivery rate in check:</span><ul data-identifyelement=\"859\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 17px; list-style: outside disc; color: var(--fw-textColor); font-size: 16px !important;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1666810225737\" data-identifyelement=\"860\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1666803879761\" data-identifyelement=\"819\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1666803889467\" data-identifyelement=\"788\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Violation Email&nbsp;</strong>-<strong class=\"tdfocus-1666803889467\" data-identifyelement=\"789\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</strong>We will send out an email notification as soon as the subaccount hits the error rate of 8% and opt-out rate of 2%.</span></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1666803886552\" data-identifyelement=\"861\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1666803884654\" data-identifyelement=\"820\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"790\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Temporary Account Restriction -</strong> We will send out a suspension email as the subaccount hits the error rate of 12.5% and opt-out rate of 3%.</span></li></ul></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"862\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; padding-top: 4px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"791\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1666803901654\" data-identifyelement=\"821\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1666803897360\" data-identifyelement=\"792\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Please Note:</strong></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1666803913328\" data-identifyelement=\"793\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: var(--bs-font-monospace); direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: bidi-override; display: block; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; overflow: auto; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1666803901654\" data-identifyelement=\"821\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">As soon as the account will hit the temporary suspension all upcoming outbound SMS will be failed till 00:00 AM UTC.</span></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"863\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; padding-top: 4px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"822\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"864\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1666643072941\" data-identifyelement=\"865\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.17em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: 0px; margin-left: 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 30px !important;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"794\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"823\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1666810594625\" data-identifyelement=\"824\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">What should we do when we get a violation email?</strong></span></h3><ol class=\"tdfocus-1666642959166\" data-identifyelement=\"867\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 17px; color: var(--fw-textColor); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; list-style: decimal; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1666643069791\" data-identifyelement=\"868\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><h3 data-identifyelement=\"825\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.17em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: var(--fw-headingsFont); margin-left: 0px; line-height: 30px !important;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"826\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><span class=\"im\" data-identifyelement=\"869\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1666642959463\" data-identifyelement=\"870\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); padding-top: 4px; text-align: justify;\">Stop all your workflows, campaigns, triggers, and/or bulk actions to contacts who have not explicitly opted in to receive messages from the sub-account.</p></span><span class=\"im\" data-identifyelement=\"869\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1666642959463\" data-identifyelement=\"870\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); padding-top: 4px; text-align: justify;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"796\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></span></span></h3></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1666810218424\" data-identifyelement=\"871\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"827\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">Enable and customize the Opt Out language and SenderID message as per your use case so that all the upcoming messages are not flagged.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"797\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"798\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1666643043374\" data-identifyelement=\"874\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"828\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">Please discuss this with your client to make no bulk communication or messages blast or cold prospecting message campaigns are sent in the near future before we receive your reply to this ticket.</span></li></ol><p data-identifyelement=\"876\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; padding-top: 4px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"829\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"877\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"878\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.17em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: 0px; margin-left: 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 30px !important;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"799\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"830\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1666642331110\" data-identifyelement=\"879\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\