trong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Lead Contact Details</strong></h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-02a56aec-65f9-43ab-8e4f-ccd4680918a0\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Users can access comprehensive lead information directly within the Point of Contacts section of the Prospecting Tool, including:&nbsp;</div><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;Lead Information: For each generated prospect, users can now access vital lead details such as their role, expertise, and more.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Social Media Profiles:&nbsp;Easily connect with prospects through their linked Facebook, Twitter, and LinkedIn profiles (if available).</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Location Details:&nbsp;Gain insights into the geographical location of prospects, helping you tailor your outreach strategies effectively.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Contact Information:&nbsp;Access essential contact details including phone numbers and email addresses, streamlining your communication process.</li></ul><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-dc3c7a2f-6c13-4c30-8a61-507825c7d8ad\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;How to Access POC Details of a Prospect:</div><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">In the Sub Account View, go to \"Prospecting\" in the side navigation menu</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Go to any Prospect Account in the Dashboard</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Proceed to Point of contacts tab to view the Lead information</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155037734164/original/j671mHrSd-TooAxz5dyd2Chxmwczn1716Q55c2.png?1733313358\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155037734164\"><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005159-wordpress-hosting-step-by-step-migration-guide", "title": "Option 1: Effortless Migration with the LC Migrator Plugin", "folder": "WordPress Folder", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795723/original/y5Pu_6hjpBm6dGZIxjBUkEIXkbvS5xwtLAcdbe.png?1745866812", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795770/original/xiHoYfAbYm3zntOc50KVGSiPCsjfs1ygVwde7a.png?1745866866", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795801/original/UQsckYcvA3jdy_WTZMGUlqaL13yve4au-waf2f.png?1745866913", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795809/original/Eo3Wyh3l3gIzj0rVgSJx4kRukofw-991tAd21d.png?1745866933", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795814/original/gN9oVQuLJuaGftaVzvVi_wzxSGr8vKVnMwcc07.png?1745866948", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795856/original/-PlJ2n1Dg85bmpN2oVc87uOKAm1JtL8NPgd532.png?1745867003", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795881/original/eZph-PGnm0DnMXRoB5T84tMSftGMjySk4w7527.png?1745867076", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795893/original/7WCwta81HO2fnXwatsJBiPqH2oAHc0U4zwe945.png?1745867087", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795894/original/1yyFiQLpRfSYMGd7PGG6GixI-cb2a_j5Og91fd.png?1745867096", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795898/original/6Iqb9vvDyvJnoPYVW2pYOhC1xE86NpiuMg4cdc.png?1745867107", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795959/original/mfTW5RSVxEtGvMVwDdxcGNME40pvkimthw8471.png?1745867237"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"258\" dir=\"ltr\">Welcome!<br data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"269\">This guide will help you seamlessly migrate your WordPress website into your new hosting environment.<br data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"373\">You have two simple options for migration \u2014 choose the one that best suits your needs.</p><p data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"258\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795723/original/y5Pu_6hjpBm6dGZIxjBUkEIXkbvS5xwtLAcdbe.png?1745866812\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795723\"></p><hr data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"464\"><h2 data-end=\"529\" data-start=\"466\" dir=\"ltr\">Option 1: Effortless Migration with the LC Migrator Plugin</h2><p data-end=\"619\" data-start=\"530\"><strong data-end=\"543\" data-start=\"530\">Best For:</strong> Fast, non-technical migrations with minimal effort<br data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-end=\"613\" data-start=\"597\">Recommended:</strong> \u2705 Yes</p><h3 data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"621\">How to Use:</h3><p data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"638\"><strong data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"638\">Step 1: Download the LC Migrator Plugin</strong></p><ul data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"684\"><li data-end=\"737\" data-start=\"684\"><p data-end=\"737\" data-start=\"686\">Click <strong data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"692\">Download Plugin</strong> to download a ZIP file.</p></li><li data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"738\"><p data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"740\">This ZIP file will be used to migrate your site.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795770/original/xiHoYfAbYm3zntOc50KVGSiPCsjfs1ygVwde7a.png?1745866866\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795770\"><br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795801/original/UQsckYcvA3jdy_WTZMGUlqaL13yve4au-waf2f.png?1745866913\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795801\"></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"793\"><p data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"795\"><strong data-end=\"866\" data-start=\"795\">Step 2: Upload the Plugin to the WordPress Site You Want to Migrate</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"869\"><li data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"869\"><p data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"871\">Log in to the WordPress dashboard of the site you want to migrate.</p></li><li data-end=\"968\" data-start=\"938\"><p data-end=\"968\" data-start=\"940\">Go to <strong data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"946\">Plugins \u2192 Add New</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"969\"><p data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"971\">Click <strong data-end=\"994\" data-start=\"977\">Upload Plugin</strong> at the top.</p></li><li data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1007\"><p data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1009\">Upload the ZIP file you downloaded and click <strong data-end=\"1069\" data-start=\"1054\">Install Now</strong>.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795809/original/Eo3Wyh3l3gIzj0rVgSJx4kRukofw-991tAd21d.png?1745866933\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795809\"></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1075\"><p data-end=\"1110\" data-start=\"1077\"><strong data-end=\"1108\" data-start=\"1077\">Step 3: Activate the Plugin</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1218\" data-start=\"1111\"><li data-end=\"1159\" data-start=\"1111\"><p data-end=\"1159\" data-start=\"1113\">After installation, click <strong data-end=\"1158\" data-start=\"1139\">Activate Plugin</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1218\" data-start=\"1160\"><p data-end=\"1218\" data-start=\"1162\">Your LC Migrator plugin is now active and ready for use.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795814/original/gN9oVQuLJuaGftaVzvVi_wzxSGr8vKVnMwcc07.png?1745866948\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795814\"><br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795856/original/-PlJ2n1Dg85bmpN2oVc87uOKAm1JtL8NPgd532.png?1745867003\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795856\"></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1223\"><p data-end=\"1266\" data-start=\"1225\"><strong data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1225\">Step 4: Open the LC Migrator Plugin</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1472\" data-start=\"1267\"><li data-end=\"1361\" data-start=\"1267\"><p data-end=\"1361\" data-start=\"1269\">In the WordPress sidebar, locate and click on <strong data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1315\">LC Migrator</strong> (you may need to scroll down).</p></li><li data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1362\"><p data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1364\">Log in using your hosting credentials.</p></li><li data-end=\"1472\" data-start=\"1403\"><p data-end=\"1472\" data-start=\"1405\">Select the destination site where you want to migrate your content.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795881/original/eZph-PGnm0DnMXRoB5T84tMSftGMjySk4w7527.png?1745867076\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795881\"></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1477\"><p data-end=\"1512\" data-start=\"1479\"><strong data-end=\"1510\" data-start=\"1479\">Step 5: Start the Migration</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1513\"><li data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1513\"><p data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1515\">After selecting the destination, click <strong data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1554\">Continue</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1610\" data-start=\"1568\"><p data-end=\"1610\" data-start=\"1570\">Choose the target website from the list.</p></li><li data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1611\"><p data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1613\">Confirm that you understand the existing site\u2019s content will be replaced.</p></li><li data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1687\"><p data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1689\">Click <strong data-end=\"1714\" data-start=\"1695\">Start Migration</strong>.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795893/original/7WCwta81HO2fnXwatsJBiPqH2oAHc0U4zwe945.png?1745867087\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795893\"></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1720\"><p data-end=\"1757\" data-start=\"1722\"><strong data-end=\"1755\" data-start=\"1722\">Step 6: Monitor the Migration</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1948\" data-start=\"1758\"><li data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1758\"><p data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1760\">The migration process typically takes <strong data-end=\"1815\" data-start=\"1798\">10\u201315 minutes</strong> for larger sites.</p></li><li data-end=\"1948\" data-start=\"1834\"><p data-end=\"1948\" data-start=\"1836\">You can cancel the migration at any point before the final step (cancellation at the last step is not possible).<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045795894/original/1yyFiQLpRfSYMGd7PGG6GixI-cb2a_j5Og91fd.png?1745867096\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155045795894\"></p></li></ul><hr da